A facade re-exports declarations by marking a direct-selection dependency clause with `$export`.

[codeblock, $code "moth":
    $export
    @components/card CardData as Card, render_card
]

Consumers can bind `Card` and `render_card`. `CardData` is not also published unless selected separately.

Without `$export`, an import stays private to its source file:

[codeblock, $code "moth":
    @components/card CardData as LocalCard
]

A re-export needs explicit selected names. Whole namespaces and namespace aliases cannot be exported. See @#public-reexports (Public re-exports).
